{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}SMS Privacy Policy — {{ brand.name }}{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<div class="container py-4" style="max-width: 760px;">
    <h1 class="fw-bold mb-1">NouriLoop SMS Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-muted">Effective date: June 9, 2026. Last updated: June 22, 2026.</p>

    <p>This SMS Privacy Policy explains how NouriLoop LLC (“NouriLoop,” “we,”
    “us”) collects, uses, and protects information in connection with the NouriLoop
    text-message (SMS) notification program.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">1. The SMS program</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop sends account/transactional notifications to users who opt in. These
    are reminders and alerts about your own nutrition data, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>a reminder if you haven’t logged any meals by evening;</li>
        <li>a reminder when your health metrics are out of date;</li>
        <li>an alert when a day’s calorie total is unusually low or high;</li>
        <li>weekly suggestions when your nutrient intake runs low.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do <strong>not</strong> send marketing or promotional text messages through
    this program.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">2. Consent and opt-in</h2>
    <p>You opt in voluntarily by entering your mobile number and selecting “Text
    message” or “Email and text” on the Settings → Notifications page, and by
    agreeing to the consent statement shown there. By doing so you agree to receive
    recurring automated SMS notifications at the number provided. Consent is
    <strong>not</strong> a condition of using NouriLoop; email delivery is always
    available as an alternative.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">3. Message frequency</h2>
    <p>Message frequency varies based on your activity and settings — typically up to
    one message per day, and not more than a few per week.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">4. Cost</h2>
    <p><strong>Message and data rates may apply</strong> according to your mobile
    carrier and plan. NouriLoop does not charge for SMS notifications.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">5. Opt-out and help</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to unsubscribe at any time.
        You will receive a one-time confirmation, after which we will send no further
        texts unless you opt in again.</li>
        <li>Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for help, or contact us at info@nouriloop.com /
        +1 (541) 559-8353.</li>
        <li>You can also turn SMS off at any time on the Settings → Notifications page.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Supported carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">6. Information we collect for SMS</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>Your mobile phone number.</li>
        <li>Your notification preferences (channel and which notice types are enabled),
        your phone number, and the date and time you gave SMS consent.</li>
        <li>Delivery metadata (e.g., timestamps and delivery status) needed to send
        messages and prevent duplicates.</li>
        <li>The content of each notification, which is derived from data already in your
        NouriLoop account.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">7. How we use this information</h2>
    <p>Solely to deliver the notifications you requested, to honor your STOP/HELP
    requests, to prevent duplicate messages, and to maintain and secure the service.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">8. How we share it</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>We share your mobile number and message content with our SMS provider,
        Twilio Inc., only as needed to transmit messages on our behalf.</li>
        <li><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates
        for marketing or promotional purposes. All of the above categories exclude text
        messaging originator opt-in data and consent; this information will not be shared
        with any third parties.</strong></li>
        <li>We do not sell your personal information.</li>
        <li>We may disclose information if required by law or to protect our rights and
        the safety of users.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">9. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain your phone number, SMS preferences, and consent record for as long as
    your account is active or as needed to provide the service, and we delete or
    de-identify this data on account closure or valid request, subject to legal
    retention requirements.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">10. Security</h2>
    <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect your
    information. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">11. Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete, or
    restrict use of your personal information (e.g., under the CCPA/CPRA or GDPR). To
    exercise these rights, contact us at info@nouriloop.com.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">12. Children’s privacy</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop and its SMS program are not directed to children under 13, and we
    do not knowingly collect their information.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">13. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy and will revise the “Last updated” date above. Material
    changes affecting SMS will be communicated before they take effect.</p>

    <h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">14. Contact</h2>
    <p>NouriLoop LLC<br>
    5441 S Macadam Ave Ste N, Portland OR 97239<br>
    info@nouriloop.com · +1 (541) 559-8353</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
